        "id": 1884045
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-25T12:00:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is not an existing @IntDef for it. We can add one, but I\u0027m not sure the PM team would like to maintain an @IntDef for it, so I prefer not to annotate the type with @IntDef.\n\nAlternatively, I can remove the `getCode` method altogether.\n\nWDYT?",
