      "lineNbr": 11889,
      "author": {
        "id": 1047684
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-25T13:15:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "However, it\u0027s a bit weird to return type X for a `verifyX` method. Just curious for local consistency. There are plenty of `get` methods in PackageManager, and are they relatively cheaper than this operation?  \n\nbtw, for concern 1, how about `getVerifiedSigningInfo`?",
